---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About, OK Studio"
  description="OK Studio is built by Owen Kent, a wheelchair user with muscular dystrophy making accessibility-first software the disability community actually needs."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero__inner">
      <p class="section-tag">// About</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Built by someone<br />who needs them.</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        OK Studio is a software studio focused on accessibility, adaptive input,
        and human-computer interaction. Every product solves a real problem the
        builder faces, or one faced by the broader disability community.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="content">
    <div class="container content-grid">
      <div class="content-main">
        <div class="prose">
          <h2>Who I am</h2>
          <p>
            I'm Owen Kent, a wheelchair user with muscular dystrophy and the
            builder behind OK Studio. I'm an FAA-certified Remote Pilot and a
            licensed ham radio operator working at the intersection of
            accessibility, engineering, and human-computer interaction.
          </p>
          <p>
            I build accessibility-first software because I use it every day.
            Typing is hard. Holding a controller is hard. The tools I make are
            the ones I wish existed when I needed them.
          </p>

          <h2>What I believe</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Accessibility is innovation.</strong> The best interfaces
            aren't dumbed down, they're smarter. Designing for disability
            pushes us to create solutions that work better for everyone.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Open source by default.</strong> Core tools are MIT
            licensed. Accessibility shouldn't be locked behind paywalls.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Nothing about us without us.</strong> I build with the
            disability community, not for them. Lived experience guides every
            decision.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Software should just work.</strong> No complicated setup,
            no accessibility "modes" buried in settings. Tools should work for
            everyone out of the box.
          </p>

          <h2>What I build</h2>
          <p>
            Three products in flight, all on the <a href="/#projects">projects page</a>:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Alpha-OSK</strong>: AI-powered on-screen keyboard for Windows and Linux. Shipping.</li>
            <li><strong>MacroVox</strong>: voice dictation for Windows. Coming soon.</li>
            <li><strong>Project Nimbus</strong>: mouse-to-virtual-joystick controller for adaptive gaming. Coming soon.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2>Get involved</h2>
          <p>
            The fastest way to support the studio is to use the tools and tell
            me what's broken. Code contributions, bug reports, and feature ideas
            all welcome on GitHub. Or just <a href="/contact/">say hi</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="content-side">
        <div class="profile-card">
          <img src="/owen.jpg" alt="Owen Kent" class="profile-image" width="240" height="240" />
          <p class="profile-name">Owen Kent</p>
          <p class="profile-role">// Founder, OK Studio</p>
          <div class="profile-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/owenpkent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/owenpkent/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">LinkedIn</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: 140px 0 4rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .page-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 10%;
    left: -15%;
    width: 500px;
    height: 500px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0, 240, 255, 0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    filter: blur(60px);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .page-hero__inner { position: relative; max-width: 720px; }

  .section-tag {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--neon-magenta);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    background: var(--gradient-cyber);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    color: transparent;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 0 20px var(--accent-glow));
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .content { padding: 4rem 0; }
  .content-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 3rem;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .content-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 2fr) 1fr; align-items: start; }
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--text);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
  .prose h2::before {
    content: '//';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    font-weight: 400;
  }
  .prose h2:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .prose p { color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  .prose ul {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.75;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .prose li {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .prose li::before {
    content: '▸';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
  }
  .prose strong { color: var(--text); }
  .prose a { color: var(--neon-cyan); }
  .prose a:hover {
    color: var(--neon-magenta);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.5);
  }

  .profile-card {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
    backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
  }
  .profile-image {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    object-fit: cover;
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    display: block;
    border: 2px solid var(--neon-cyan);
    box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--accent-glow);
  }
  .profile-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .profile-role {
    margin: 0.25rem 0 1rem;
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
  }
  .profile-links {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
  }
  .profile-links a {
    color: var(--neon-cyan);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .profile-links a:hover {
    color: var(--neon-magenta);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 170, 0.5);
  }
</style>
